  <data name="DeviceIdWarning" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Changing the ID renames every entity this application publishes. Anything pointing at the old names stops working, with no error reported anywhere.

The old entities are removed from the broker, and their recorded history does not carry over to the new ones.

Leaving the box empty falls back to the name derived from this machine.</value>
